1
00:00:00,148 --> 00:00:02,108
Your memaw died?

2
00:00:04,236 --> 00:00:05,366
(Sheldon:)That's terrible.

3
00:00:05,529 --> 00:00:07,529
(Wil Wheaton:)Yeah. It was.

4
00:00:07,697 --> 00:00:10,827
(Wil Wheaton:)But I'm really sorry
that I disappointed you.

5
00:00:11,034 --> 00:00:13,574
(Sheldon:)No, no, I understand.

6
00:00:13,787 --> 00:00:17,417
If anything happened to my memaw,
I'd be one inconsolable Moon Pie.

7
00:00:19,334 --> 00:00:23,834
(Sheldon:)I should clarify that statement
by explaining that she calls me Moon Pie.

8
00:00:24,589 --> 00:00:28,259
It's a special relationship, isn't it?
Between a boy and his grandmother.

9
00:00:28,426 --> 00:00:29,846
(Sheldon:)-Oh, yes.
RAJESH: Yeah, okay.

10
00:00:30,011 --> 00:00:32,101
(Raj:)Okay, great,
everybody loves their grandmas.

11
00:00:32,264 --> 00:00:35,604
(Raj:)Now, come on, Sheldon,
finish him off.

12
00:00:36,101 --> 00:00:38,231
Yeah. It's okay, Sheldon.
I let you down.

13
00:00:38,395 --> 00:00:40,225
(Wil Wheaton:)I deserve it.

14
00:00:40,397 --> 00:00:41,727
(Sheldon:)Potion of Zancor.

15
00:00:44,109 --> 00:00:46,899
(Raj:)What are you waiting for?

16
00:00:47,112 --> 00:00:51,362
(Raj:)Kill Wil Wheaton.
From hell's heart, stab at him.

17
00:00:54,911 --> 00:00:58,121
(Leonard:)-I can't.
-Sure you can. Do it. Do it.

18
00:00:58,874 --> 00:01:00,334
(Penny:)No.

